<section class="concept" aria-labelledby="crce-motion-title">
 <p class="eyebrow">Design concept</p><h2 id="crce-motion-title">Opposing rotation. A shared balance target.</h2>
 <svg viewBox="0 0 700 240" role="img" aria-label="Two schematic crank markers rotating in opposite directions. Illustrative motion, not a simulation of the CAD assembly.">
  <g fill="none" stroke="#27383c" stroke-width="3"><circle cx="210" cy="110" r="70"/><circle cx="490" cy="110" r="70"/></g>
  <g class="left" stroke="#7ce6c4" stroke-width="5"><line x1="210" y1="110" x2="210" y2="48"/><circle cx="210" cy="48" r="9" fill="#7ce6c4"/></g>
  <g class="right" stroke="#e4b56e" stroke-width="5"><line x1="490" y1="110" x2="490" y2="172"/><circle cx="490" cy="172" r="9" fill="#e4b56e"/></g>
  <g fill="#a5b7b9" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle"><text x="210" y="215">Crankshaft 1</text><text x="490" y="215">Crankshaft 2</text><text x="350" y="115">M₁ = M₂</text></g>
 </svg><p>Illustrative counter-rotation and initial phase offset. This diagram explains the balancing intention; it does not calculate piston motion, torque, vibration, or deformation.</p>
</section>
<style>.concept{padding:28px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);margin:32px 0}.concept h2{font-size:25px;margin-top:10px}.concept svg{width:100%;max-height:270px}.concept p:last-child{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.left{transform-origin:210px 110px;animation:turn 7s linear infinite}.right{transform-origin:490px 110px;animation:turn 7s linear infinite reverse}@keyframes turn{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.left,.right{animation:none}}</style>
